    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1428">

                <pb facs="1253" n="995" xml:id="pg995"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The</hi>
                    
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary of State</hi>
                    
                    <hi rendition="#italic">to the Minister in Persia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                    >Caldwell</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-11-19T17:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 19, 1915, 5 p. m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your November 17, 3 p. m. Department approves your assuming temporary charge
                    German and Turkish interests subject to approval of those Governments. Please
                    keep Department fully informed regarding situation. You will use the greatest
                    care and discretion in extending protection to nationals other than Americans
                    citizens.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
